# Booking inquiry webhook.
#
# Use the n8n PRODUCTION url (/webhook/...). The editor's test url
# (/webhook-test/...) fires once per manual "Listen for test event" click and
# 404s after that, so it will appear to work and then silently stop.
#
# The n8n workflow needs a "Respond to Webhook" node — or a response mode that
# doesn't require one — otherwise every call returns 500 even though the
# trigger fired correctly.
INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Shared secret for the webhook's JWT Auth credential in n8n (algorithm HS256).
# When set, every forwarded booking carries a freshly signed, five-minute
# bearer token. Set the identical value on the n8n side or it answers 403.
INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_JWT_SECRET=

# Optional, and superseded by the JWT above. Sent as the X-Webhook-Secret
# header, for receivers that check a plain shared header instead.
INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
